Welcome to the witching hour.

2
00:10:37,894 --> 00:10:43,894
The Craft is a horror, drama, fantasy film directed by Andrew Fleming.

3
00:15:56,842 --> 00:16:02,842
A Catholic school newcomer falls in with a clique of teen witches who wield their powers against
all who dare to cross them -- be they teachers, rivals or meddlesome parents.

